# Prompt builder

`buildPrompt(specimen, mode)` with modes `'full' | 'code' | 'contract'`.

## Output rules (assert in tests)

- Never mention this site, this repo, or the word “playground”
- Imperative second person, present tense
- When `motion.respectsReducedMotion`, always include a reduced-motion clause
- Outer fences are 3 backticks; escalate to 4 if content contains ```
- Acceptance → `- [ ]` checklist; integration → numbered steps

## CopyButton

- `navigator.clipboard.writeText` with `execCommand` fallback
- 1.6s confirm: verdigris border + label swap — no toast, no icon animation
- `aria-live="polite"`: `Prompt copied — {n} characters`
- Failure: label → `Copy failed — select the prompt below` + selected read-only textarea
- Errors state what happened and what to do; they do not apologise
